{"id":"cau-truc-ham-function-trong-c-cach-truyen-tham-so","chapterId":"chuong-2","chapterNumber":2,"chapterTitle":"ĐIỀU KHIỂN LUỒNG","order":2,"lessonNumber":2,"title":"Cấu trúc Hàm (Function) trong C++. Cách truyền tham số","wordCount":232,"estimatedMinutes":5,"headings":[{"level":2,"text":"1. Cấu trúc cơ bản của hàm","id":"1-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-ham"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Khai báo nguyên mẫu hàm (Function Prototype)","id":"2-khai-bao-nguyen-mau-ham-function-prototype"},{"level":2,"text":"3. Hàm không trả về giá trị (void)","id":"3-ham-khong-tra-ve-gia-tri-void"},{"level":2,"text":"4. Các cách truyền tham số","id":"4-cac-cach-truyen-tham-so"},{"level":3,"text":"a) Truyền theo giá trị (Pass by value)","id":"a-truyen-theo-gia-tri-pass-by-value"},{"level":3,"text":"b) Truyền theo tham chiếu (Pass by reference)","id":"b-truyen-theo-tham-chieu-pass-by-reference"},{"level":3,"text":"c) Truyền theo con trỏ (Pass by pointer)","id":"c-truyen-theo-con-tro-pass-by-pointer"},{"level":2,"text":"So sánh nhanh","id":"so-sanh-nhanh"},{"level":2,"text":"5. Truyền mảng/vector vào hàm","id":"5-truyen-mang-vector-vao-ham"},{"level":2,"text":"6. Tham số mặc định (Default parameter)","id":"6-tham-so-mac-dinh-default-parameter"},{"level":2,"text":"Mẹo khi thi đấu","id":"meo-khi-thi-dau"}],"contentHtml":"<h2 id=\"1-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-ham\">1. Cấu trúc cơ bản của hàm</h2><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span>kieu_tra_ve <span class=\"tk tk-s\">ten_ham</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>danh_sach_tham_so<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// thân hàm</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">return</span> gia_tri<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><p>Ví dụ:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">sum</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">return</span> a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">+</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">main</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> s <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">sum</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// s = 7</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"2-khai-bao-nguyen-mau-ham-function-prototype\">2. Khai báo nguyên mẫu hàm (Function Prototype)</h2>\n<p>Nếu hàm được định nghĩa <strong>sau</strong> <code>main()</code>, cần khai báo nguyên mẫu trước:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">sum</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// prototype</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">main</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">sum</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">sum</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">,</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">return</span> a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">+</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">9</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"3-ham-khong-tra-ve-gia-tri-void\">3. Hàm không trả về giá trị (<code>void</code>)</h2><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">printHello</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"Hello\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// không có return, hoặc return; (không kèm giá trị)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"4-cac-cach-truyen-tham-so\">4. Các cách truyền tham số</h2>\n<h3 id=\"a-truyen-theo-gia-tri-pass-by-value\">a) Truyền theo giá trị (Pass by value)</h3>\n<p>Hàm nhận <strong>bản sao</strong> của biến — thay đổi bên trong hàm <strong>không</strong> ảnh hưởng biến gốc:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">increase</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> x<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">+</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">main</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-s\">increase</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// vẫn in ra 5</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">9</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"b-truyen-theo-tham-chieu-pass-by-reference\">b) Truyền theo tham chiếu (Pass by reference)</h3>\n<p>Dùng <code>&amp;</code>, hàm thao tác <strong>trực tiếp</strong> trên biến gốc:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">increase</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&amp;</span>x<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">+</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">main</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-s\">increase</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// in ra 6</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">9</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h3 id=\"c-truyen-theo-con-tro-pass-by-pointer\">c) Truyền theo con trỏ (Pass by pointer)</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">increase</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span>x<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span>x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">*</span>x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">+</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">main</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-s\">increase</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">&amp;</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// in ra 6</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">9</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"so-sanh-nhanh\">So sánh nhanh</h2>\n<div class=\"lesson-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Cách truyền</th><th>Cú pháp</th><th>Thay đổi ảnh hưởng biến gốc?</th><th>Tốc độ với dữ liệu lớn</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Theo giá trị</td><td><code>void f(int x)</code></td><td>Không</td><td>Chậm (sao chép dữ liệu)</td></tr><tr><td>Theo tham chiếu</td><td><code>void f(int &amp;x)</code></td><td>Có</td><td>Nhanh (không sao chép)</td></tr><tr><td>Theo con trỏ</td><td><code>void f(int *x)</code></td><td>Có</td><td>Nhanh, nhưng cú pháp phức tạp hơn</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"5-truyen-mang-vector-vao-ham\">5. Truyền mảng/vector vào hàm</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mảng C-style: luôn được truyền dưới dạng con trỏ (dù không ghi <code>&amp;</code>), nên hàm <strong>có thể</strong> thay đổi mảng gốc.</li>\n<li><code>vector</code>: nên truyền bằng tham chiếu <code>const vector&lt;int&gt;&amp;</code> để <strong>tránh sao chép</strong> dữ liệu lớn, tăng tốc độ:</li>\n</ul><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">process</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">const</span> vector<span class=\"tk tk-t\">&amp;</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// chỉ đọc, không sao chép toàn bộ vector</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">modify</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>vector<span class=\"tk tk-t\">&amp;</span> a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">.</span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">push_back</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-n\">10</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// thay đổi vector gốc</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"6-tham-so-mac-dinh-default-parameter\">6. Tham số mặc định (Default parameter)</h2><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">void</span> <span class=\"tk tk-s\">greet</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>string name <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"bạn\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"Xin chao \"</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> name <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">greet</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>          <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// Xin chao ban</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span><span class=\"tk tk-s\">greet</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"An\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>       <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// Xin chao An</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"meo-khi-thi-dau\">Mẹo khi thi đấu</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Với <code>vector</code>, <code>string</code> lớn → luôn truyền bằng <code>const &amp;</code> để tránh TLE do sao chép dữ liệu thừa.</li>\n<li>Với biến cần thay đổi trực tiếp (ví dụ: đếm kết quả qua nhiều hàm đệ quy) → dùng tham chiếu <code>&amp;</code>.</li>\n</ul>"}